WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:02.030
- Seriously though, I can't believe

00:00:02.030 --> 00:00:03.450
that like we've never met.

00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:04.283
- I know
- I know

00:00:04.283 --> 00:00:06.491
- And I lived in Nashville for like,

00:00:06.491 --> 00:00:08.320
(audience laughing) for like 12 years.

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:10.920
- Like how have we never met?
- Cheers!

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:11.753
- Cheers!

00:00:11.753 --> 00:00:13.836
(audience clapping)

00:00:13.836 --> 00:00:15.300
- So this is the best,

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:18.040
'cause I get what prayer
warriors are of where I'm from.

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:19.720
But like--
- Texas, my Texas girl!

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:22.102
- Texas exactly! And I
know a prayer warrior.

00:00:22.102 --> 00:00:25.760
So you prayed so hard when
you heard Carrie Underwood,

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:28.530
she was thinking about having
y'all open for the tour right?

00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:29.810
- Yes so word got out--

00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:31.973
- Apparently you got a
line straight to God girl!

00:00:31.973 --> 00:00:32.806
- Girl let me tell you.

00:00:32.806 --> 00:00:35.650
- He was fed up with us by
the time we got the tour.

00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:37.840
- We had this kinda crazy couple of years.

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:39.530
We were with a record company for a while

00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:41.740
and then they just out
of nowhere shut down

00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:43.090
while we were making our second record.

00:00:43.090 --> 00:00:44.560
So we were kind of in this like,

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:45.410
crazy limbo.

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.200
We were on this huge peak of our career

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:50.200
and then just like crazy just,

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:51.033
like this.

00:00:51.033 --> 00:00:52.760
So we started rebuilding

00:00:52.760 --> 00:00:54.660
and just like pushing forward and forward.

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:57.090
And so word got out at our label

00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:59.330
that we were on like the list.

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:00.486
And so Tay and I,

00:01:00.486 --> 00:01:03.170
we had all of Texas and Oklahoma praying,

00:01:03.170 --> 00:01:05.100
I was like Grandma, every single day.

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:07.940
Before every single show we
would sit in the back lounge

00:01:07.940 --> 00:01:09.940
and we'd say God please, please, please

00:01:09.940 --> 00:01:11.670
put us on the Carrie
Underwood tour please!

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:13.210
And he was finally like,

00:01:13.210 --> 00:01:14.785
like when I talk about God,

00:01:14.785 --> 00:01:16.450
it's like Octavia Spencer,

00:01:16.450 --> 00:01:17.307
like that's kinda my vibe.

00:01:17.307 --> 00:01:18.415
(laughing)

00:01:18.415 --> 00:01:19.925
(audience laughing)

00:01:19.925 --> 00:01:20.758
- Mine's more of Morgan Freeman.

00:01:20.758 --> 00:01:22.190
- Yeah it has nothing to do with the movie

00:01:22.190 --> 00:01:23.359
that he played God.

00:01:23.359 --> 00:01:24.192
- So God was like,

00:01:24.192 --> 00:01:25.790
Girls, I'm sick of y'all asking for this,

00:01:25.790 --> 00:01:28.000
I'm just gon' give it to ya.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:29.389
So here we go.

00:01:29.389 --> 00:01:30.389
- I love it!

